  "type": "Toggle",
  "display_name": "Turbulent Aura",
  "display_fullname": "Controller Control Water Control Turbulent Aura",
  "display_help": "You create a barrier of rapidly flowing water around you causing foes that enter the aura to suffer minor cold damage and have a chance to be knocked down while inside it.  The caster will also heal for a small amount of health for each Drowning foe within the aura.  Turbulent Aura has a small chance to inflict Drowning on targets. Damage: Minor, Recharge: Moderate",
